---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Headerfile from '../components/Headerfile.astro';
import Footerfile from '../components/Footerfile.astro';
---

<Layout>
    <Headerfile />
        <div id="about">
            <p id="aboutme">About Me</p>
                <ul id="text">
                    <li>
                        I chose computer science because I’m fascinated by how technology can be used to solve real-world problems. This interest grew into a passion for building data-driven and intelligent systems that create positive impact.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Through my studies and projects, I’ve worked with machine learning, data analysis, and application development, including a wildfire prediction model and research in an AI4Good lab. I enjoy turning complex problems into practical tools.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        I’m especially interested in work that combines artificial intelligence, data, and social impact, and I hope to continue growing as a software engineer while contributing to meaningful and responsible projects.
                    </li>
                </ul>
        </div>
    <Footerfile />
</Layout>

<style>
    #about{
        display:flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        
    }

    #aboutme{
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
        color: #EEDEDB;
        font-size: 42pt;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    #text{
        color: #CFD6EE;
        font-size: 18pt;
        font-family: 'Lucida Sans', 'Lucida Sans Regular', 'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Sans Unicode', Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }
</style>